Stop the test:

Shell
pkill yes
Test Scenario 2: High Memory

Generate memory consumption:

Shell
python3 -c "a=['A'*1024*1024]*500"

Or use stress-ng:

Shell
sudo apt install stress-ng -y
 
stress-ng --vm 2 --vm-bytes 1G --timeout 120s

Watch Grafana Memory Dashboard.

Test Scenario 3: High Disk Usage

Create a large file:

Shell
dd if=/dev/zero of=testfile.img bs=1M count=2048

This creates about 2 GB.

Check:

Shell
df -h

Watch Disk Usage panel.

Remove file:

Shell
rm -f testfile.img
